error BYN2743: `+` cannot be applied to a value of type parameter `T`

  1 │ T add<T>(T a, T b) => a + b;
    │                       ^^^^^
    │
  help: type parameters have no constraints: a `T` can only be copied, compared with `==` and `!=`,
        passed, stored, returned and formatted

